    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a source of fascination for me since high school. While I find some topics like physics and economics challenging, maths itself feels more intuitive. I enjoy solving problems because they feel like puzzles waiting to be cracked. It's not just about grades; it's about understanding patterns in the world.",
